It's just the rest of the game was so hard for me to, at least for me particularly, to avoid anything, to knock and hit.

00:28:37.300 --> 00:28:40.060
That, like, the bosses felt like a break from it all to me.

00:28:40.140 --> 00:28:46.740
Like, the bosses, the bosses were, like, unbalanced in almost the opposite way that bosses usually are in these older games.

00:28:46.740 --> 00:28:51.460
Where it's, like, a lot of times you'll get to a boss and it's just so ridiculously hard where, like, that really makes you think.

00:28:51.560 --> 00:28:55.160
This is just, like, the rest of the level is, like, the boss for me.

00:28:56.460 --> 00:29:01.180
Like, after I beat the first boss, I feel like level two is the actual, is, like, the boss.

00:29:01.460 --> 00:29:04.080
And, like, oh, I can't wait to get to the next level, which is the T-Rex.

00:29:04.380 --> 00:29:09.940
Right. It's funny because, uh, Sean made a great point of the fact that they've removed everything else.

00:29:09.940 --> 00:29:21.420
But, you know, the attacks of these bosses, right, that if we're supposed to believe that they're the extra hard fight in each level, they attack infrequently as well.

00:29:21.600 --> 00:29:25.160
